.TH ARC-SBS-GUI 1 "2026-10-20" "de-xr" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
arc\-sbs\-gui \- graphical front end for Arc SBS conversion
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
arc\-sbs\-gui
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Open the Qt6 front end for Arc SBS conversion and previews. The GUI requires the gui dependency extra and the same prepared model and GPU runtime as the command\-line converter. Conversion settings and supported backends depend on the installed build.
.SH SEE ALSO
arc\-sbs(1), qimgvr(1)
